  "id": 203714578788946,
  "uuid": "2eabdc02-5592-4ed6-b52e-ef43129a2525",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "1d0126d6-5749-01cf-7d07-d6240ed1ad2d",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "855023be-5532-352d-901f-e9a1e642f431",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"Their establishment was the culmination of a 21-year journey that saw\nindividuals from around the world come together to create a groundbreaking\ninstitution capable of educating a new generation of leaders and of tackling\nsome of the most profound challenges facing the developing world,\" said AKU President Firoz\nRasul  in a statement to the University\ncommunity.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"Three decades later, the vision and values the Chancellor articulated in\nhis speech on November 11, 1985 are as relevant as ever. Then as now, we\nare devoted to achieving excellence, raising standards far beyond our\ncampuses, serving the disadvantaged and forging connections\nbetween communities, countries and faiths. And we remain as inspired\nand committed by the Chancellor's vision today, as he had articulated it then,\"\nhe added.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Read\nthe Chancellor's speech",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.aku.edu/about/chancellor/Pages/inauguration-fhs-and-akuh-khi.aspx",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " and you will surely gain a deeper\nunderstanding of the past, present and future of the Aga Khan University.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
