    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Thirty-two years ago today\nin Karachi, His Highness the Aga Khan, Chancellor of the Aga Khan University,\ninaugurated the University's Faculty of Health Sciences and the Aga Khan\nUniversity Hospital.",
